WEBVTT

00:05.530 --> 00:09.070
So this is... the angel palace.

00:12.450 --> 00:14.340
What a nasty stench...

00:15.100 --> 00:18.280
Just as I thought. It was you, Reiren.

00:19.990 --> 00:24.110
What did you just say, War Angel Vicious?

00:24.540 --> 00:27.930
Soon, the execution of the Great
Elder of the elves will take place.

00:28.340 --> 00:32.810
It'll serve as a message
to the elves, fairies, and dwarves:

00:32.810 --> 00:35.540
You are inferior to the angels.

00:36.430 --> 00:37.680
Bow down!

00:41.470 --> 00:42.410
Fire!

00:43.920 --> 00:46.730
I can't believe you would bring
humans to the angel palace!

00:47.090 --> 00:50.480
Jeanne-sama, leave this to us
and go on ahead.

00:51.240 --> 00:54.300
To think that the humans
would fight against the angels...

00:54.300 --> 00:56.950
Yeah, we hear that a lot.

00:56.950 --> 00:58.200
Look out!

01:04.500 --> 01:08.750
To oppose our Lord is a foolish thing.

01:09.090 --> 01:10.630
Kai, go on ahead!

01:11.010 --> 01:12.090
Rinne...

01:14.410 --> 01:15.510
Make sure you catch up to us!

01:15.960 --> 01:19.630
I see. You choose to sacrifice
yourself for the others.

01:19.630 --> 01:22.140
What are you talking about? I just thought...

01:24.180 --> 01:26.350
I want to give it my all!

01:27.320 --> 01:32.270
I'm sorry for leaving the most dangerous
battle, the one with Vanessa, to you.

01:32.930 --> 01:34.480
I've wanted to say that for some time.

01:35.470 --> 01:36.540
Jeanne...

01:38.660 --> 01:41.740
I'll be fighting alongside you this time.

01:47.560 --> 01:48.620
Great Elder!

01:51.340 --> 01:53.710
The heavens are filled with rage.

01:55.260 --> 02:01.130
Those without wings, the earth dwellers,
those who look up at the heavens...

02:03.060 --> 02:04.810
Why do you disobey?

02:05.800 --> 02:07.560
Lord Alfreya...

02:08.050 --> 02:12.880
All blessings come from the Heavens
and are bestowed upon the earth.

02:12.880 --> 02:14.550
This is divine providence.

02:15.790 --> 02:17.360
But...

02:19.110 --> 02:22.110
Only the angels are entitled
to receive such blessings.

02:35.300 --> 02:39.840
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?

03:54.900 --> 03:57.750
Storm, surround my ax,

03:58.250 --> 04:00.970
and tear them to pieces!

04:00.970 --> 04:01.900
Jump!

04:09.340 --> 04:11.580
That sword is a mythical beast's...

04:12.770 --> 04:14.690
A drake's fang, isn't it?

04:15.250 --> 04:19.590
I hear their power erupts through impact.

04:20.180 --> 04:22.650
You seem to know a bit about it.

04:23.120 --> 04:26.160
The celestial race is skilled
at creating such magic items.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.640
It's only natural that we'd know.

04:28.050 --> 04:31.830
Yet your lord is attempting to force
slavery upon those very same celestials.

04:31.830 --> 04:35.000
He must be quite arrogant.

04:36.070 --> 04:37.460
How naive.

04:38.120 --> 04:41.670
It is not something mere humans can fathom.

04:50.870 --> 04:52.780
How fierce...

04:54.270 --> 04:58.060
To think you'd pierce through
my divine guard so easily.

04:58.060 --> 05:01.280
You are indeed a threat.

05:01.660 --> 05:06.390
Liar. My attacks aren't working
on you much at all, are they?

05:07.630 --> 05:09.290
I hate how composed you are.

05:09.940 --> 05:13.580
You angels are all the same.
You look down on others.

05:14.220 --> 05:17.900
That's why even elves, fairies,
and dwarves seem inferior to you.

05:20.670 --> 05:26.670
Tell me, strange-looking intruder,
what exactly are you?

05:28.070 --> 05:31.560
I don't know, and I don't
want to know, either...

05:32.610 --> 05:37.420
I don't need to know as long as Kai
stays with me. That's all that matters!

05:42.770 --> 05:48.510
We will now proceed with the execution
of the Great Elder of the elves...

05:58.730 --> 06:00.080
Alfreya!

06:00.620 --> 06:04.040
You have no right to lead the celestials!

06:04.040 --> 06:06.470
I shall guide you to your grave!

06:08.970 --> 06:10.180
Magnificat.

06:10.630 --> 06:13.690
O holy star, come down upon earth!

06:16.430 --> 06:17.310
Watch out!

06:16.920 --> 06:19.310
Come on! Please work, Code Holder!

06:28.280 --> 06:31.320
Are you truly a human?

06:32.120 --> 06:36.230
Or are you an elf pretending to be a human?

06:37.390 --> 06:40.790
No, I'm all human.

06:40.790 --> 06:43.140
I fail to understand.

06:43.140 --> 06:46.050
To think a human would defend an elf...

06:46.050 --> 06:47.980
There's nothing to question.

06:49.070 --> 06:53.240
If something were to happen to Reiren,
the elves would resent us.

06:54.100 --> 06:56.720
It makes sense to help her.

06:57.180 --> 06:59.220
Your existences are not the same...

06:59.220 --> 07:02.960
your life and that puny elf's life.

07:03.330 --> 07:04.990
If your judgment had been even a bit off,

07:04.990 --> 07:07.650
you would have been reduced
to ashes along with that elf.

07:08.620 --> 07:12.000
That sword. It's no ordinary weapon, is it?

07:13.340 --> 07:17.580
This sword was able to rival Vanessa,
the demon hero, and her magic.

07:18.170 --> 07:20.710
It has the potential to challenge you.

07:21.810 --> 07:23.060
Vanessa?

07:29.990 --> 07:33.910
I see. That dirty demon.

07:33.910 --> 07:37.140
How foolish of her to lose to a human...

07:37.950 --> 07:38.880
I wonder.

07:39.100 --> 07:40.220
What?

07:40.920 --> 07:44.330
You think that highly of yourself?

07:44.330 --> 07:45.450
That's not it.

07:46.010 --> 07:51.110
What I'm saying is, are you really
in a position to call Vanessa a fool?

07:51.520 --> 07:52.710
What did you say?

07:53.520 --> 07:58.500
At least she wasn't trying to
execute her own subordinates.

08:00.810 --> 08:03.730
That is for me to decide.

08:03.730 --> 08:06.000
I am heaven's spire.

08:06.490 --> 08:10.920
I am the noblest and
most brilliant star there is.

08:11.500 --> 08:16.310
I have no desire to call anyone
who would disobey me my subordinate.

08:17.250 --> 08:19.720
That's what we call narrow-mindedness.

08:20.680 --> 08:21.880
Take this!

08:21.880 --> 08:23.640
Longbow of the Moon!

08:31.330 --> 08:33.860
An elven bow... huh?

08:34.180 --> 08:40.300
Human, do you truly understand what it means
to wield an elven weapon with that body?

08:41.950 --> 08:45.830
I think nothing of draining my own life away.

08:45.830 --> 08:48.290
Your life? Jeanne, what do you—

08:48.290 --> 08:49.500
We'll talk later.

08:50.250 --> 08:53.920
Right now, we need to
take down this angel.

08:54.380 --> 08:57.030
A profane fool, throwing your life away...

08:57.880 --> 08:59.160
Magnificat.

09:01.420 --> 09:03.130
Heavenly Thunder.

09:10.040 --> 09:13.790
Oh? An elf's sacred light garment, huh?

09:14.690 --> 09:19.770
It can handle any magic,
even if it is an attack from a hero.

09:20.120 --> 09:21.550
Unforgivable.

09:22.200 --> 09:26.430
For a human to use celestial items
and wear elven garments...

09:27.690 --> 09:28.750
Magnificat.

09:29.390 --> 09:32.590
Behold, the glorious judgment of light!

09:34.460 --> 09:36.090
Seven princess guardians...

09:36.090 --> 09:38.140
Third princess, respond!

09:48.070 --> 09:49.020
Reiren...

09:49.660 --> 09:53.280
I refuse to be in debt to humans so many times.

09:55.630 --> 09:58.660
Either way, it'd be better if we could
make it four against one.

09:58.940 --> 10:00.840
So we need to get the Great Elder first.

10:01.450 --> 10:03.800
You seem to be pretty sharp for a human.

10:04.380 --> 10:05.560
Come with me!

10:08.350 --> 10:09.320
It's useless.

10:10.730 --> 10:11.840
Magnificat.

10:11.840 --> 10:13.530
Spear of Divine Punishment.

10:14.240 --> 10:15.470
Fourth princess!

10:21.860 --> 10:23.630
You mere human...

10:24.140 --> 10:26.980
You take humans too lightly, angel.

10:27.640 --> 10:31.500
Hold on, Great Elder! I'll save you right now!

10:34.340 --> 10:35.470
How can this be?

10:35.890 --> 10:38.170
That was one of the elven treasures.

10:39.390 --> 10:43.200
A casket that can seal away the Great Elder,
who's second only to the heroes...

10:45.910 --> 10:48.540
A spear that can easily
pierce through my barriers...

10:51.330 --> 10:53.210
A bell that summons thunder...

10:56.670 --> 10:58.880
A baton that creates a red blade...

11:00.900 --> 11:05.960
How are you able to use
all of these magic items at once?

11:07.030 --> 11:10.380
Even if you are a hero,
you should be depleting a lot of magic.

11:11.240 --> 11:13.160
What is that power?

11:13.850 --> 11:18.170
Could this power be what caused you
to suddenly change?!

11:19.590 --> 11:21.150
"Suddenly change"?

11:21.460 --> 11:22.700
That's not what this is.

11:23.230 --> 11:24.950
This is a rapture.

11:25.590 --> 11:29.620
The joy of attaining a new
subordinate to replace you.

11:29.620 --> 11:30.550
What?!

11:31.060 --> 11:32.250
What is that?

11:32.870 --> 11:34.330
That thing is...

11:35.270 --> 11:36.940
Allow me to introduce to you...

11:37.370 --> 11:39.960
my amenable subordinate...

11:39.960 --> 11:41.610
Last Riser.

11:44.050 --> 11:47.060
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?

11:47.050 --> 11:50.060
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?

11:53.540 --> 11:55.270
Is that all you've got?

11:55.270 --> 11:57.520
You, too! You're holding back, aren't you?

11:57.520 --> 11:59.570
What are you talking about?!

12:06.040 --> 12:09.680
How dare you sully my wings?!

12:10.500 --> 12:13.300
You asked for it!

12:23.470 --> 12:25.610
Ashran, Saki! Her wings!

12:32.270 --> 12:33.600
Why you!

12:35.970 --> 12:39.130
Your wings are the source of your magic...

12:39.640 --> 12:41.340
and your weakness.

12:43.400 --> 12:45.110
How... did you...

12:45.540 --> 12:48.740
I asked a man who claims
to come from another world.

12:49.610 --> 12:52.450
Another world...

12:57.980 --> 13:00.140
Move on ahead.

13:00.990 --> 13:02.020
You're...

13:02.510 --> 13:09.470
Make haste. With your powers,
you may be able to free the Great Elder.

13:10.420 --> 13:13.720
Did you... lose on purpose?

13:13.720 --> 13:15.130
Who knows?

13:15.590 --> 13:20.570
However, since the day when
Lord Alfreya first changed...

13:21.430 --> 13:27.630
Vicious and I persevered and
waited for this moment.

13:27.630 --> 13:29.670
Now go.

13:29.670 --> 13:32.620
Go. Will you apologize on my behalf?

13:32.980 --> 13:33.960
Apologize?

13:34.800 --> 13:36.290
To who and for what?

13:36.940 --> 13:38.380
To my old friends...

13:39.020 --> 13:40.800
Tell the Great Elder and Reiren

13:41.820 --> 13:43.630
that Vicious sends her apologies.

13:45.170 --> 13:46.800
As if I care.

13:47.450 --> 13:51.310
You certainly took me lightly by clashing
blades with me instead of flying.

13:51.310 --> 13:52.560
So much for being an angel.

13:52.560 --> 13:53.500
Falin-sama!

13:53.500 --> 13:55.480
A-Are you sure it's okay?

13:55.940 --> 13:59.610
I have no intention of finishing off
anyone who wasn't being serious.

14:00.680 --> 14:05.130
If you want to apologize,
take us up to where they are.

14:11.070 --> 14:12.000
Do it.

14:24.340 --> 14:25.270
Jeanne!

14:25.980 --> 14:27.120
Jeanne!

14:40.720 --> 14:41.950
No damage?!

14:45.540 --> 14:46.680
Rinne...

14:47.500 --> 14:50.550
You saved me, Rinne. Thank you.

14:51.800 --> 14:57.200
Once this battle is over, I'll have you
and Kai explain in detail, all right?

14:59.340 --> 15:00.540
Okay.

15:04.220 --> 15:05.150
Kai.

15:05.940 --> 15:07.050
Yeah.

15:08.350 --> 15:11.940
What is that awful mixed being?

15:12.980 --> 15:15.810
Kai, that thing in front of him is...

15:15.810 --> 15:18.310
Yeah, it's a Last Riser.

15:19.570 --> 15:23.460
Alfreya, are you the one
behind the world reincarnation?

15:23.460 --> 15:27.110
World reincarnation?
What are you talking about?

15:27.480 --> 15:29.130
You don't know?

15:30.170 --> 15:32.760
What's going on? Vanessa knew...

15:33.940 --> 15:35.740
Then how about Sid?

15:35.740 --> 15:37.870
Do you know who Prophet Sid is?

15:38.650 --> 15:39.700
Sid...

15:40.580 --> 15:41.790
Sid?!

15:43.410 --> 15:45.380
The Prophet, Sid...

15:48.250 --> 15:49.560
I received it.

15:50.450 --> 15:53.130
I... received it...

15:53.590 --> 15:56.220
from... that human...

16:00.690 --> 16:02.860
Y-You...

16:03.450 --> 16:07.460
Observing unexpected fluctuations
from the hero of the celestials.

16:07.910 --> 16:11.110
Influence from the taboo word "Sid."

16:12.360 --> 16:14.180
Executing zero code.

16:14.670 --> 16:17.610
Removing Alfreya's code from the world.

16:18.370 --> 16:20.870
Hero overwrite initiated.

16:32.600 --> 16:33.760
This is...

16:40.510 --> 16:41.770
What is going...

16:55.130 --> 16:57.870
What... just happened?

16:58.420 --> 17:02.540
I... don't know what I'm observing...

17:03.950 --> 17:06.620
It's the same... as before.

17:24.470 --> 17:29.150
Does this... Does it mean it's over?

17:30.940 --> 17:32.220
Still...

17:53.090 --> 17:54.730
Alfreya?

17:55.900 --> 17:56.950
Wait!

17:58.870 --> 18:00.470
His wings...

18:02.270 --> 18:04.810
I am Alfreya...

18:05.650 --> 18:08.580
His Avatar.

18:10.200 --> 18:12.620
What is that?

18:13.630 --> 18:15.310
Why do you look like that?

18:16.530 --> 18:22.280
Now initiating memories
as the hero of the celestials...

18:27.650 --> 18:30.080
Avatar... overwrite.

18:40.080 --> 18:41.980
World reincarnation activated.

18:41.980 --> 18:44.510
Executing the overwriting of the world.

18:46.030 --> 18:49.600
Back then, it was overwriting the world...

18:50.350 --> 18:54.150
And now it's overwriting a hero?!

18:55.260 --> 18:58.010
Only I am of importance.

18:58.010 --> 19:00.320
Only I exist within the heavens.

19:00.740 --> 19:05.420
Therefore, everything else
must be incinerated!

19:06.530 --> 19:07.930
Alfreya...

19:08.540 --> 19:10.170
Magnificat.

19:10.170 --> 19:15.130
Lord, cleave their wings,
cast them to earth, and weep.

19:26.610 --> 19:27.540
No...

19:54.350 --> 19:58.860
Did he just use magic without
channeling it through magic items?

19:59.750 --> 20:05.470
This is the work of the heavens,
my powers as the shining star.

20:05.470 --> 20:06.430
You're wrong!

20:07.000 --> 20:08.890
Wake up, Alfreya!

20:08.890 --> 20:11.020
You're just being delusional!

20:11.020 --> 20:11.950
Look!

20:12.450 --> 20:14.210
Your wings are crying!

20:14.210 --> 20:16.480
You're not enhancing your strength.

20:16.480 --> 20:18.760
You're just chipping away at your life!

20:19.630 --> 20:21.930
Celestials take pride in their magic items!

20:21.930 --> 20:26.070
You've forgotten that and take delight
in using magic without them.

20:26.070 --> 20:29.050
That's something to be
ashamed of as a celestial!

20:29.050 --> 20:29.950
Silence.

20:29.950 --> 20:31.830
All guardian princesses align!

20:31.830 --> 20:33.030
Sixth princess!

20:35.790 --> 20:37.760
No matter how strong it may be,

20:37.760 --> 20:41.550
a single use of magic is no match
for my seven princess guardians.

20:41.900 --> 20:43.550
Magnificat.

20:43.550 --> 20:45.510
Divine Gift of the King's Sword.

20:49.820 --> 20:50.960
I can't believe it.

20:51.610 --> 20:55.370
For my seven princess guardians
to break so easily...

20:57.780 --> 20:59.320
Death to all fools!

20:59.320 --> 21:01.180
Alfreya!

21:03.360 --> 21:04.570
Alfreya!

21:05.450 --> 21:08.640
Reiren really looked up to you.

21:09.330 --> 21:13.200
Somewhere in her heart,
she had faith in your return...

21:13.710 --> 21:15.280
Laughable.

21:15.280 --> 21:18.670
I have no intention of going along
with a weakling's fantasies.

21:20.520 --> 21:22.250
Laughable, you say...

21:23.090 --> 21:24.800
Fantasies, you say...

21:25.230 --> 21:29.970
If you were the one that Reiren respected,
you wouldn't say such things!

21:33.750 --> 21:38.480
What would a mere human understand?

21:38.880 --> 21:40.320
Oh, I understand.

21:40.320 --> 21:44.600
I understand that you're not
the person Reiren adores,

21:44.600 --> 21:46.760
nor the leader of the celestial race.

21:47.330 --> 21:51.030
You're an imitation
reproducing the hero's powers!

21:51.320 --> 21:52.320
Kai...

21:53.170 --> 21:54.350
You...

22:02.020 --> 22:03.390
Kai...

22:05.090 --> 22:10.010
Episode 7
"Heartless Angel"

23:34.300 --> 23:40.020
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?
